    <description
  >Runs before a Case is saved (no extra DML, fastest option). New case without a contact but with a supplied email (web/email intake): links the contact with that email. New case with only a Community Code (Web-to-Case cannot fill lookups): finds the community, the unit by Web Unit Number and the active category by Web Category name. New case with a category: owner = the category's queue, SLA Due = now + category SLA Hours (kept if already set, e.g. migrated data). Any case whose community is new/changed: copies Community Code for sharing rules. Case moving to Closed: stores Resolution Hours.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>HoursSinceCreated</name>
        <dataType>Number</dataType>
        <expression
    >ROUND(({!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} - {!$Record.CreatedDate}) * 24, 2)</expression>
        <scale>2</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>IsClosingNow</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression
    >NOT(ISNEW()) &amp;&amp; ISPICKVAL({!$Record.Status}, &quot;Closed&quot;) &amp;&amp; ISCHANGED({!$Record.Status})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>IsNewOrCommunityChanged</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>ISNEW() || ISCHANGED({!$Record.Community__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>IsNewRecord</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>ISNEW()</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>SlaDue</name>
        <dataType>DateTime</dataType>
        <expression
    >IF(ISBLANK({!$Record.SLA_Due__c}), {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime} + ({!Get_Category.SLA_Hours__c} / 24), {!$Record.SLA_Due__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>Case - Before Save {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>Case - Before Save: Routing, SLA and Resolution Time</label>
